                                "sense_id": "890fe4b6-7847-31bf-b963-eb3bce26b231",
                                "text": "Lord Peter, and the martyrologic, aeolistic, ass-skulled Jack, who are more than thumb-nail sketches or abstractions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f5f00fb-2f89-4f4e-829a-2fbd1123c712",
                                "sense_id": "890fe4b6-7847-31bf-b963-eb3bce26b231",
                                "text": "Instead, Mitchell superintends only a coastal shipping firm with an appropriately aeolistic name, the Oceanic Steam Navigation Company."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
